criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
General inclusion criteria: sufficient knowledge of the German language, ability to give informed consent;
MCI patients: clinical MCI diagnosis;
Relatives: relatives of persons with MCI, regular contact with persons with MCI; Representatives of counseling centers: representatives of counseling centers, regular contact with persons with MCI
Exclusion criteria:
General exclusion criteria: insufficient knowledge of the German language,
illiteracy;
MCI patients: diagnosis of dementia, evidence of a non-AD neurodegenerative disease such as: Parkinson's disease, Lewy body dementia, frontotemporal lobar degeneration, very rapid cognitive deterioration within a few weeks or months (classically indicative of prion disease, neoplasia or metabolic disorder);
Relatives: no additional
Representatives of counseling centers: no additional
